---
/**
 * The live region toasts are appended to. Render it ONCE per page, usually in
 * the layout. Raise toasts with `toast()` from ./toast.
 *
 * `polite`, not `assertive`: a toast reports something that already happened.
 * Anything that must interrupt belongs in a dialog, not here.
 */
---
<div class="ds-toast-region" role="region" aria-live="polite" aria-label="Notifications" data-ds-toasts></div>
